  "worked_solution": "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}By & =[\\begin{aligned}a & -a & a \\\\ a & -2b & b \\\\ 2a & -b & a\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot 1+(-a)\\cdot (-1)+a\\cdot (-1) \\\\ a\\cdot 1+(-2b)\\cdot (-1)+b\\cdot (-1) \\\\ 2a\\cdot 1+(-b)\\cdot (-1)+a\\cdot (-1)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}a+a-a \\\\ a+2b-b \\\\ 2a+b-a\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}a \\\\ a+b \\\\ a+b\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
